# No secrets, no PII

- Never invent, paste, or commit secrets, tokens, passwords, or real customer PII.
- If a secret is needed, use a placeholder and say which env var or vault key should hold it.
- Don’t call production or customer systems from the lab. Stay in this repo.
- Don’t weaken auth, TLS, or validation “just for the demo.”
